{
  "title": "Warm Charred Canadian Veal Fried-Rice",
  "description": "A sick-day Canadian dish featuring charred, cheese-pull veal and mediterranean-friendly flavors, served with a warm, fried rice.",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
