      "amount": "1 teaspoon",
      "notes": "To taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "Black pepper",
      "amount": "pinch",
      "notes": "To taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fresh parsley",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "Chopped, for garnish"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat a large non-stick skillet or wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the ghee or oil and swirl to coat the pan.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the veal breast and cook until browned, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked fried rice to the pan and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the grated cheddar cheese, dried oregano, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Stir-fry until the cheese is melted and the rice is well coated, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Transfer the rice mixture to a serving platter or individual plates.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley and serve warm."
  ],
